    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You run a <strong>delivery service</strong> with your friends, aiming to complete as <strong>many deliveries</strong> as possible to earn enough money to <strong>pay the rent</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231300/extras/f695139335a15dec7248c5f7612d0de5.poster.avif?t=1749052981\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231300/extras/f695139335a15dec7248c5f7612d0de5.webm?t=1749052981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231300/extras/f695139335a15dec7248c5f7612d0de5.mp4?t=1749052981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>The city is<strong> alive</strong>, with people and cars around the streets. But these might <strong>not be the only inhabitants</strong> of the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231300/extras/a8f3afecad6d74fdd2eba1280457e2bb.poster.avif?t=1749052981\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231300/extras/a8f3afecad6d74fdd2eba1280457e2bb.webm?t=1749052981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231300/extras/a8f3afecad6d74fdd2eba1280457e2bb.mp4?t=1749052981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><strong>Communicate</strong> through<strong> proximity voice chat </strong>or by <strong>using the radio</strong> on your bike. <strong>Don't</strong> stray too far from it if you want to stay connected with your teammates, as getting lost is easy and you might become the unfortunate <strong>victim</strong> of an accident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231300/extras/a7925d20ae3469df76935f97d7928a13.poster.avif?t=1749052981\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231300/extras/a7925d20ae3469df76935f97d7928a13.webm?t=1749052981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231300/extras/a7925d20ae3469df76935f97d7928a13.mp4?t=1749052981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Always remember to pay the rent; we don't want to anger our landlord, <strong>s\u0335\u0351\u0302\u031d\u0330\u0325i\u0335\u0302\u0341\u0346\u0332\u0355\u031cn\u0338\u0360\u033cc\u0335\u0344\u0309\u0320e\u0338\u033f\u0327 \u0338\u0301\u0332\u032bh\u0335\u0304\u0305\u030e\u032c\u032ee\u0338\u030a\u0345\u031e\u0316 \u0335\u030a\u0354i\u0338\u0306\u0354\u033cs\u0337\u034c\u0305\u0357\u0317 \u0335\u0314\u0301\u0340\u035cs\u0334\u0352\u0319\u0347\u0325o\u0335\u0344\u034d\u0319 \u0338\u030d\u0314\u0333n\u0337\u0302\u0356i\u0334\u0314\u030d\u0304\u0339\u0320c\u0337\u0305\u0315\u0352\u0322\u0331\u033be\u0337\u0304\u0341\u0308\u0324\u0327!\u0337\u0310\u0343\u0316\u0332</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231300/extras/ef5c46ea6f9ef40f0c6f2385a3e40d96.poster.avif?t=1749052981\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231300/extras/ef5c46ea6f9ef40f0c6f2385a3e40d96.webm?t=1749052981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231300/extras/ef5c46ea6f9ef40f0c6f2385a3e40d96.mp4?t=1749052981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>UNCOVER THE SECRETS</strong>Learn about the monsters and the lore around the city, <i>what happened to all of them?</i><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231300/extras/79da4a44d6490068927669eff52083ef.poster.avif?t=1749052981\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231300/extras/79da4a44d6490068927669eff52083ef.webm?t=1749052981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231300/extras/79da4a44d6490068927669eff52083ef.mp4?t=1749052981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You run a <strong>delivery service</strong> with your friends, aiming to complete as <strong>many deliveries</strong> as possible to earn enough money to <strong>pay the rent</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231300/extras/f695139335a15dec7248c5f7612d0de5.poster.avif?t=1749052981\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231300/extras/f695139335a15dec7248c5f7612d0de5.webm?t=1749052981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231300/extras/f695139335a15dec7248c5f7612d0de5.mp4?t=1749052981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>The city is<strong> alive</strong>, with people and cars around the streets. But these might <strong>not be the only inhabitants</strong> of the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231300/extras/a8f3afecad6d74fdd2eba1280457e2bb.poster.avif?t=1749052981\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231300/extras/a8f3afecad6d74fdd2eba1280457e2bb.webm?t=1749052981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231300/extras/a8f3afecad6d74fdd2eba1280457e2bb.mp4?t=1749052981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><strong>Communicate</strong> through<strong> proximity voice chat </strong>or by <strong>using the radio</strong> on your bike. <strong>Don't</strong> stray too far from it if you want to stay connected with your teammates, as getting lost is easy and you might become the unfortunate <strong>victim</strong> of an accident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231300/extras/a7925d20ae3469df76935f97d7928a13.poster.avif?t=1749052981\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231300/extras/a7925d20ae3469df76935f97d7928a13.webm?t=1749052981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231300/extras/a7925d20ae3469df76935f97d7928a13.mp4?t=1749052981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Always remember to pay the rent; we don't want to anger our landlord, <strong>s\u0335\u0351\u0302\u031d\u0330\u0325i\u0335\u0302\u0341\u0346\u0332\u0355\u031cn\u0338\u0360\u033cc\u0335\u0344\u0309\u0320e\u0338\u033f\u0327 \u0338\u0301\u0332\u032bh\u0335\u0304\u0305\u030e\u032c\u032ee\u0338\u030a\u0345\u031e\u0316 \u0335\u030a\u0354i\u0338\u0306\u0354\u033cs\u0337\u034c\u0305\u0357\u0317 \u0335\u0314\u0301\u0340\u035cs\u0334\u0352\u0319\u0347\u0325o\u0335\u0344\u034d\u0319 \u0338\u030d\u0314\u0333n\u0337\u0302\u0356i\u0334\u0314\u030d\u0304\u0339\u0320c\u0337\u0305\u0315\u0352\u0322\u0331\u033be\u0337\u0304\u0341\u0308\u0324\u0327!\u0337\u0310\u0343\u0316\u0332</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231300/extras/ef5c46ea6f9ef40f0c6f2385a3e40d96.poster.avif?t=1749052981\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231300/extras/ef5c46ea6f9ef40f0c6f2385a3e40d96.webm?t=1749052981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231300/extras/ef5c46ea6f9ef40f0c6f2385a3e40d96.mp4?t=1749052981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>UNCOVER THE SECRETS</strong>Learn about the monsters and the lore around the city, <i>what happened to all of them?</i><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231300/extras/79da4a44d6490068927669eff52083ef.poster.avif?t=1749052981\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231300/extras/79da4a44d6490068927669eff52083ef.webm?t=1749052981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231300/extras/79da4a44d6490068927669eff52083ef.mp4?t=1749052981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
